* Remove sheep and goat because of outfields
PARAMETER LU(PRDK) Livestock units  /
       MKYR   1
       AKYR   1
       OKSS   1
       KVGS   1
       KVGO   1
       OKKS   .6
       KVKS   .6
       OKKO   .6
       KVKO   .6
*       SOEY   .15
       SOEY   0
       LAMS   0
*       GEIT   .15
       GEIT   0
       KJES   0
/;
