* include sheep and goat
PARAMETER LU1(PRDK) Livestock units  /
       MKYR   1
       AKYR   1
       OKSS   1
       KVGS   1
       KVGO   1
       OKKS   .6
       KVKS   .6
       OKKO   .6
       KVKO   .6
       SOEY   .15
       LAMS   0
       GEIT   .15
       KJES   0
/;

